{"id": "EUVD-2026-31449", "enisaUuid": "5ba34794-2e53-366d-851a-74d238e4a399", "description": "The ToASCII and ToUnicode functions incorrectly accept Punycode-encoded labels that decode to an ASCII-only label. For example, ToUnicode(\"xn--example-.com\") incorrectly returns the name \"example.com\" rather than an error. This behavior can lead to privilege escalation in programs using the idna package. For example, a program which performs privilege checks on the ASCII hostname may reject \"example.com\" but permit \"xn--example-.com\". If that program subsequently converts the ASCII hostname to Unicode, it will inadvertently permits access to the Unicode name \"example.com\".", "datePublished": "2026-05-22T15:01:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-17T12:04:30", "baseScore": 9.6, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://go.dev/cl/767220", "https://go.dev/issue/78760", "https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/iI-mYSI0lu8", "https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/94pEornpRlI", "https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2026-5026"], "aliases": ["GHSA-w2q5-6q6x-x959", "CVE-2026-39821"], "assigner": "Go", "epss": 0.69, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "15c1ac25-ba7b-33cc-b557-c83f9fd8578a", "product": {"name": "net/http/internal/http2", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}, "product_version": "1.26.0-0 <1.26.6"}, {"id": "1fd85e43-65b7-3f15-ac0b-c24df9fd9d0d", "product": {"name": "net/http", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.25.13"}, {"id": "7be45dad-608b-3dcf-a2a6-b641c332c388", "product": {"name": "net/http", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}, "product_version": "1.27.0-0 <1.27.0-rc.3"}, {"id": "c8ffdbd7-8281-3b4a-9186-d1b7e882d047", "product": {"name": "net/http/internal/http2", "vendor": {"name": "Go standard library"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.25.13"}, {"id": "cf14c010-3dff-357e-8b14-1941fcb1a504", "product": {"name": "golang.org/x/net/idna", "vendor": {"nam